# 🔥 MobiGo Auth Service — Complete Revision Guide (Part 1)
# Project Structure, Code Flow & Line-by-Line Explanation

---

## 📁 Project Structure (Folder Map)

```
services/auth/
├── .env                    ← 🔐 Secret config (PORT, DB URL, JWT Secret)
├── package.json            ← 📦 Project ki dependencies list
├── tsconfig.json           ← ⚙️ TypeScript compiler settings
├── src/                    ← 💻 Source code folder
│   ├── index.ts            ← 🚀 ENTRY POINT (Server yahan start hota hai)
│   ├── config/
│   │   └── db.ts           ← 🗄️ MongoDB se connection
│   ├── model/
│   │   └── User.ts         ← 👤 User ka data shape (Schema + Interface)
│   ├── middlewares/
│   │   ├── trycatch.ts     ← 🛡️ Error handling wrapper
│   │   └── isAuth.ts       ← 🔒 Authentication check middleware
│   ├── controllers/
│   │   └── auth.ts         ← 🎮 Business logic (Login + Role assign)
│   └── routes/
│       └── auth.ts         ← 🛤️ URL endpoints define
└── dist/                   ← 📤 Compiled JS output (auto-generated)
```

